Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.20,0:00:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello! It's me again, Molo! Today I have\Nthree golden tips for your teeth.\NAnd no, I don't mean real gold.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.80,0:00:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,So, first: Brush twice a day, that's a must!\NSecond: Visit your dentist at least once a year,\Npreferably us. And third: Less sugar!\NYeah, I know, that's the hard part.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.00,0:00:24.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember: Your teeth are your best accessory.\NStop by, I'm waiting for you! Bye!
